## 7. Final AI Decision

The CEO recommended a phased omnichannel modernization programme, beginning with the highest-performing physical stores.

The proposed approach includes:

- Improving inventory accuracy.
- Modernizing checkout and merchandising.
- Introducing pickup and returns capabilities.
- Supporting local delivery and ship-from-store.
- Building the operational and customer-data foundation for a scalable digital channel.
- Expanding investment when measurable performance milestones are achieved.

The decision also acknowledges that if `$0M` is literally zero available capital, both major initiatives should be deferred until funding becomes available.

